  "ruleText": "Rev 2002.01 Method of Accounting. Village districts shall use a double entry system of bookkeeping to record all financial transactions.\n\nSource. #5454, eff 8-28-92; ss by #6809, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8686, eff 7-21-06; ss by #10675, eff 9-24-14; ss by #14072, eff 9-10-24",
